  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID WSSH Data and Analytics Activity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAIDs Water Security, Sanitation, and Hygiene Data &amp; Analytics (WSSH D&amp;A) Activity aims to increase the use of data and analytics in WSSH to accelerate progress toward a water-secure world. It will enable the Agency to increase data use to improve programming in the near term and strengthen the data ecosystem of the broader WSSH sectors in the longer term.</narrative>
  </description>
